      "content": "That's a very strong way of framing it. I love how you characterize the economic factors as just a \"stage.\" \n\nTo finish this piece, I want to end on a really definitive note. Could you write a concluding paragraph that essentially declares the \"materialist\" or \"socioeconomic\" view of history as outdated and incorrect when it comes to the French Revolution? I want it to state that any serious study of this era must center on the individual's will, because to do otherwise is to ignore the actual driver of human progress.",
